Package: kalinka-plugin-webradio
Version: @VERSION@
Section: python
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: kalinka-server (>= 5.19.0), kalinka-server (<< 6), kalinka-plugin-sdk (>= 3.22), kalinka-plugin-sdk (<< 4), python3 (>= 3.11), ca-certificates
Maintainer: Dmitry Savin <envelsavinds@gmail.com>
Description: Internet radio for Kalinka Player from radio-browser.info
 Lists stations from the radio-browser.info directory by popularity, genre,
 country and language, searches them by name, and plays their streams.
